            Every machine here ran the same protocol, because generator specifications are written on a bench and outages happen in a back garden in February. We connected each unit through a manual transfer switch to a household load of refrigerator, chest freezer, furnace blower, a cycling sump pump and lighting, then added a window air conditioner and, on the larger units, a well pump and a central air compressor to find where each ran out.
