          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            3. What Size Portable Generator Do You Need?
          </h2>

          <p>
            This is the decision that determines whether the machine is useful or resented, and it is made badly more often than any other in this category. Buy too small and it trips every time the well pump starts; buy too large and you own something heavy, thirsty and loud that never gets moved.
          </p>

